A constitutional referendum was held in [[Balisca]] on 23 July 2022. Voters were asked whether they approved a [[Constitution of Balisca|new constitution]] which included extensive changes to the composition and powers of the [[Confederal Congress]], the adoption of a [[Basic Law: Protection of Privacy|thirteenth]] [[Basic Laws of Balisca|Basic Law]], as well as reforms regarding the division of powers between the [[Government and politics of Balisca|confederal administration]], the [[Regions of Balisca|regions]], and [[Cantons of Balisca|cantons]] and [[Communes of Balisca|communal]] entities. 

